    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if there isn't a \"real me\" waiting under there? what if the person I was was just a byproduct of being with them? it's like a shadow that's realized its source is gone. i just feel so useless. like i'm just waiting for a clock to run out on a life i didn't even really own. it's exhausting to try and find something that might not even exist.",
